TITLE Exchange transport test
SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    units mmol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
SAVE solution 1
SAVE exchange 1
END
USE solution 1
USE exchange 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -correct_disp true
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivities 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step ex4_NaX
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, MOL("NaX")
END
